    {"claim": "60-80% of maintenance effort is comprehension — reading and understanding code, not modifying it. When AI generates the code, that knowledge never existed inside your organization.", "targets": []},
    {"claim": "AI-generated code is technical debt taken on at scale, all at once, with zero institutional understanding of the principal.", "targets": []},
    {"claim": "The question is: who at your table represents the maintenance engineers who will inherit this code in month four, and do they have the political power to demand the rewrite that Product and Finance will never voluntarily fund?", "targets": []}
